          "subType": "m",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Target will forget what transpired in a certain period of time specified by the caster (the beginning of the time period must be within 1 day per level of the caster in the past). The length of the \"forgetting\" time period is equal to the amount of time the caster plays/sings (concentrates)."
        }
